{"author": "tfm2mods", "dependencies": [{"mod_id": "base", "version": ">=0.7.4, <0.7.5"}], "last_updated": "2026-11-25", "mod_id": "tfm2_champ_pos_lock", "name": "Champion Position Lock", "version": "0.7.8", "description": "Decide which champions may play each position. Your own draft, the AI teams, head coach delegation and background league matches all follow the same rules.\n\n* Champion pool per position: choose the allowed champions for Top, Jungle, Mid, Bottom and Support. A position with an empty list allows every champion.\n* Draft: champions that would make a legal lineup impossible are greyed out and can't be clicked, like Fearless. Hover a greyed card to see why.\n* Swap phase: your lineup is moved to a legal order once. An illegal swap shows \"This swap is not valid.\" and Confirm stays disabled.\n* Never gets stuck: a position with too few champions for your draft rules is treated as unrestricted, and the grey-out lifts when nothing legal is left.\n* Settings window with class filter (Tank included), name search, select all by class and a \"now / needed\" bar per position.\n\nOpen it from Options > Gameplay > Position Lock > Configure. The lists are stored in each save - save the game to keep them.\n\nBuilt for game 0.7.4. The mod hooks the game's draft code, so it is rebuilt for each game update; on any other game version the game disables it. Code mod (native DLL, Windows only)."}